EnergyCommunity.core.database

Scope & Responsibilities:
- Encapsulates state persistence, data integrity, and storage access for the energy community.
- Serves as the Single Source of Truth for system data (users, houses, assets, hardware configurations).

Component Boundaries & Visibility:
- VISIBILITY: PRIVATE / INTERNAL to the backend core.
- Single-Writer Boundary: This component holds sole authority for committing persistent changes to the primary store.
- Boundary Rule: Other components (telemetry, client applications) must never access or query persistence mechanisms directly. State access is mediated strictly through interfaces exposed via core.api.
